### Submit a basic email job
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "send_email",
  "payload": {
    "email": "test@example.com"
  }
}

### Submit a job that will likely fail (to test retry + DLQ)
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "send_email",
  "payload": {
    "email": "fail@example.com"
  }
}

### Submit an unknown job type (will always fail + go DEAD)
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "generate_report",
  "payload": {
    "reportId": "q4-2026"
  }
}

### Get job status — replace the ID with a real one
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_JOB_ID

### Get a completed job
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/3fe15724-e0db-4207-93f1-2b3f8de7a70d

### Get a dead/failed job — should show errorMessage
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/13c35f5f-6e25-45cd-873c-7e52ea6d9f1e

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000


### Send a real email
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "send_email",
  "payload": {
    "to": "nagaladinnemahesh@gmail.com",
    "subject": "Job Queue Test 2",
    "body": "This email was processed asynchronously by a background worker."
  }
}